1
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:10,260
=Dungeon Archive=

2
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,400
ESC, please step forward.

3
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:14,680
No.

4
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:17,460
(He Da is ESC)

5
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:19,340
I'm sorry!

6
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:19,940
(Nan Do is Infected)

7
00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:23,260
(ESC, Infected)

8
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,220
(ESC's Confession)

9
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:26,440
I'm He Da.

10
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,240
I'm ESC too.

11
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,440
When Li Attention led everyone

12
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:31,480
to unlock my memories,

13
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,120
everything from the real world

14
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:35,280
came flooding back.

15
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,880
(Exit Game)
I ripped out the ESC key

16
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:40,360
and trapped everyone in Door of Truth.

17
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,660
(Door of Truth is a life-sim game)

18
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,080
My parents died in an accident,

19
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:45,280
so my uncle raised me.

20
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,480
Life there was miserable.

21
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:50,240
His family blew through my inheritance

22
00:00:51,160 --> 00:00:52,200
and most days,

23
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,800
left me alone in a tiny room.

24
00:00:54,640 --> 00:00:55,440
Growing up,

25
00:00:55,440 --> 00:00:57,560
my only friend was an old computer.

26
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,480
Whatever I typed, it responded.

27
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:03,480
For once, I felt heard.

28
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:06,040
That's why I fell for coding

29
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,720
and dreamed of making games.

30
00:01:08,440 --> 00:01:09,440
I studied nonstop

31
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,200
(Acceptance letter)
and got into my dream course.

32
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,400
By then, my uncle had kicked me out.

33
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,660
(Crepes)
So I worked at a crepe stall

34
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,320
(Hot griddle, do not touch)
to pay tuition.

35
00:01:16,320 --> 00:01:18,960
The owner turned out to be a creep.

36
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:19,760
(I'm guilty)
His constant abuse

37
00:01:19,760 --> 00:01:21,880
gave me somatic symptom disorder.

38
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:22,860
(Somatic Symptom Disorder)

39
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:23,960
Only in dreams

40
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,920
could I breathe.

41
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:28,080
There, I was born rich,

42
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:30,520
with life on my side.

43
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:32,200
(It's okay. Dreams mean the opposite)
No one judged my worth

44
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,800
(Bad Review)
by good and bad reviews.

45
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,120
Those dreams gave me an idea.

46
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,200
I thought,

47
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:38,960
if real life only hurts,

48
00:01:38,960 --> 00:01:39,840
why not build

49
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,280
a world just for dreaming?

50
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,440
(Someday, I'll build a world
like this in a game)

51
00:01:42,440 --> 00:01:44,480
(A bright future lies ahead)
But I couldn't do it alone.

52
00:01:44,480 --> 00:01:45,920
On 1 February 2025,

53
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:48,400
I posted online looking
for people like me.

54
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,560
Soon,

55
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:51,760
(Seeking a team for a life-reboot game)
I found a whole group like me.

56
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,120
They were Ning 2K,

57
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:53,840
Jin Pretty,

58
00:01:53,840 --> 00:01:54,760
Ding Dang,

59
00:01:54,760 --> 00:01:55,600
Ke Cutie,

60
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:56,520
Nan Do,

61
00:01:56,520 --> 00:01:57,400
and Li Attention.

62
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:59,280
Together, we built our dream game,

63
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,520
(Door of Truth is a life-sim game)
Door of Truth.

64
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:03,280
Ding Dang even made our logo, Loading.

65
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,120
A life reboot was perfect for us,

66
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:07,040
(Don't Make a Fuss)
a group whose lives were a mess.

67
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,080
With each other behind us,

68
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:09,300
for the first time,

69
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:10,020
(I won't bully anyone again! I was wrong!)
we got angry,

70
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:10,800
(Loading strikes! Bully expelled)
we fought back,

71
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,880
(Case Report)
and made our abusers pay.

72
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,680
We helped others like us too.

73
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:17,400
(Good job, Loading!)
Before long,

74
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,520
(Loading is the light of the dark web!)
Loading became a dark-web hero.

75
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,420
(Popularity)

76
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:22,120
For a while,

77
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:24,440
we'd never been happier.

78
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:26,940
(Loading faces massive backlash)
Then one story brought us down.

79
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:27,940
(Heartless, Psychos)

80
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:29,000
(Fake justice, Hypocrites)
Someone revealed

81
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,720
(Self-serving vigilantes)
that one person we'd targeted

82
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,640
(Serial killer)
had been killed by Loading.

83
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:34,040
The internet turned on us.

84
00:02:34,040 --> 00:02:35,240
(Still praising them? Read the news)
We tried to explain

85
00:02:35,240 --> 00:02:37,840
that we only meant to warn them.

86
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,240
But someone was dead.

87
00:02:39,240 --> 00:02:40,960
Nothing we said mattered.

88
00:02:40,960 --> 00:02:43,160
What we once called justice

89
00:02:43,160 --> 00:02:45,680
turned violence overnight.

90
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:48,280
Everything we believed fell apart.

91
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:50,720
(Don't Make a Fuss)
Our mental health got worse again.

92
00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:53,200
On 21 February 2026,

93
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:54,680
Li Attention shared an article

94
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:57,640
about the Tui Healing Sanatorium.

95
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,600
He talked us into going,

96
00:02:58,600 --> 00:03:00,640
so we checked in.

97
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:02,480
They gave us their best treatment

98
00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:04,080
(Medication File: EMO Fly Away)
and their top medication,

99
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:05,280
(Calms anxiety and stabilizes mood)
EMO Fly Away.

100
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:09,000
(Three-Step Treatment Plan)
We relived our trauma again and again.

101
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,760
(Discharge is a new beginning)
Everyone else got better and left.

102
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,240
We didn't.

103
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,560
I gave up.

104
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,520
I stopped taking my meds

105
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:18,520
and quit trying in therapy.

106
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:19,760
Then I got lucky.

107
00:03:20,760 --> 00:03:22,360
On 5 March 2026,

108
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,920
I noticed something was off.

109
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:26,480
Our aide

110
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,720
looked exactly

111
00:03:27,720 --> 00:03:30,640
(Success Story: Wang)
like Wang, a recovered patient.

112
00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:33,080
Their features were strikingly similar.

113
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,600
(Success Stories: Wang, Yu, Fang)
So I checked the article again.

114
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:36,600
Yu looked like an assistant,

115
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:39,720
and Fang looked
like one of the patients.

116
00:03:39,720 --> 00:03:41,800
I started paying closer attention.

117
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:43,840
(Liu, Severe OCD)
Liu was hospitalized for severe OCD,

118
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:47,400
but through the window,
I saw his bed was a complete mess.

119
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:49,400
(Zhao, Terrified of Cats)
Zhao said she was terrified of cats,

120
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,680
but she hid cat food

121
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,280
and had cat hair on her clothes.

122
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,040
Then on her nightstand,

123
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,600
(Episodes Today, Performance Schedule)
I found a performance schedule.

124
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,920
That's when it hit me.

125
00:03:56,920 --> 00:03:58,960
The whole place was fake.

126
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:01,010
(Tui Healing Sanatorium: Intake Records)
They were all actors.

127
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:01,540
(Fake)

128
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:03,400
To gather more evidence,

129
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,280
I snuck into the director's office.

130
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,800
I tried every trick I knew,

131
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,760
but couldn't crack his computer.

132
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:09,500
(Access Denied)

133
00:04:09,640 --> 00:04:11,000
All I found

134
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:13,880
was a drawer packed with EMO Fly Away.

135
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,480
There was a note on top,

136
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:17,510
saying that given enough time,

137
00:04:17,510 --> 00:04:19,620
we'd all eventually break.

138
00:04:19,620 --> 00:04:20,340
(They'd eventually break)

139
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:22,200
(EMO Fly Away)
That's when I realized the medicine

140
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,080
was poison,

141
00:04:23,080 --> 00:04:25,360
(Poison)
slowly breaking us down.

142
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,440
I'd stopped taking it.

143
00:04:26,440 --> 00:04:28,640
That's why I hadn't broken.

144
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,640
I switched my friends' pills

145
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,880
and told them the truth.

146
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,040
They just stared at me

147
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:35,440
with empty eyes,

148
00:04:35,440 --> 00:04:36,760
like they couldn't understand me.

149
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,800
They blamed themselves,

150
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,840
saying it was their fault

151
00:04:40,840 --> 00:04:42,080
and they deserved to fail.

152
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:46,000
The drugs had wrecked their judgment.

153
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,160
So I called our families.

154
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,520
(Happy Family)
They all told me the same thing.

155
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:52,080
(Uncle)
I was too sensitive,

156
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:53,720
and there's nothing wrong
with the center.

157
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:55,800
I was naive.

158
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,760
If our families understood us,

159
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:59,720
we wouldn't be here.

160
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,120
So I turned to the internet.

161
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:03,040
(Help: Tui Healing may be a scam)
When they heard I was mentally ill,

162
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,780
(Stop lying. They're helping you)
they called me a liar.

163
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,600
How ironic.

164
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,720
Online,

165
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:10,760
everyone says they support people
with depression.

166
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:13,320
But show them your real pain,

167
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:16,440
and suddenly you're crazy.

168
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,280
With nowhere to turn,

169
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:18,840
things got even worse.

170
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,800
On 9 March 2026,

171
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,120
Li Attention died by suicide.

172
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:22,670
Goodbye.

173
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,440
(EMO Fly Away)
I'd switched the meds,

174
00:05:25,440 --> 00:05:26,800
but he still couldn't hold on.

175
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,680
That's when I knew

176
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:31,240
the damage couldn't be undone.

177
00:05:31,240 --> 00:05:33,560
The others had that same empty stare.

178
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:36,240
Sooner or later, they'd follow him.

179
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,800
I couldn't lose them too.

180
00:05:38,040 --> 00:05:38,800
So I acted.

181
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,020
I worked nonstop

182
00:05:40,020 --> 00:05:41,420
(Door of Truth, created on 2026.03.01)
to finish Door of Truth.

183
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,520
On 10 March 2026,

184
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,600
the game design was done.

185
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:48,200
On 13 March 2026,

186
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,880
I extracted everyone's memories.

187
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:52,360
Then I created Li Attention's
digital avatar

188
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,960
and a dream world for each of them.

189
00:05:54,960 --> 00:05:57,520
I also hired Designer Bai
to maintain the system.

190
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:59,600
On 14 March 2026,

191
00:05:59,600 --> 00:06:01,360
I knew the game would erase my memory,

192
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,200
so just in case,

193
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,720
I hid code inside my memories.

194
00:06:04,720 --> 00:06:07,080
If anyone unlocked my deepest memories,

195
00:06:07,080 --> 00:06:09,800
I'd remember the real world.

196
00:06:09,800 --> 00:06:11,480
By 23 March 2026,

197
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,960
(Dungeon 1, 2, 3, 4)
all their dream worlds were ready.

198
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:15,160
I kept asking

199
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:16,280
until they finally agreed

200
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,720
to sneak out

201
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:20,400
and try Door of Truth
at Li Attention's place.

202
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:22,480
(Door of Truth is a life-sim game)
Nan Do wasn't feeling well,

203
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,240
but joined remotely.

204
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,600
On 24 March 2026,

205
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:29,040
we began logging into the Door of Truth.

206
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:30,280
I secretly planted a piece of code

207
00:06:30,280 --> 00:06:32,000
(Exit Game)
and removed the ESC key.

208
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:34,440
There was no going back

209
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:37,040
as Ning 2K, Jin Pretty,
Ding Dang, Ke Cutie,

210
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,960
Nan Do and Li Attention
began logging in.

211
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,320
If we've tried a thousand times

212
00:06:41,320 --> 00:06:43,480
and life still shuts us out,

213
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:46,480
then let's start over in a world
of our own.

214
00:06:46,480 --> 00:06:47,880
(Door of Truth is a life-sim game)
My dearest friends,

215
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:48,960
from now on,

216
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,760
let's dream there together.

217
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,480
Loading.

218
00:06:53,460 --> 00:07:13,820
=The Truth (Season 4)=
(Finale Calendar)

219
00:07:30,610 --> 00:07:34,610
♪Come now, players all,
let the game of reason start♪

220
00:07:34,610 --> 00:07:39,050
♪Unlock each hidden trial,
let courage spark the dark♪

221
00:07:41,050 --> 00:07:45,210
♪Night falls slow, shadows grow,
the sleuth is lost inside the maze♪

222
00:07:45,210 --> 00:07:49,450
♪Figures pass, lanterns sparse,
dark currents drift without a trace♪

223
00:07:49,450 --> 00:07:53,210
♪Wind picks up, footsteps rush,
cold laughter swallowed by the dark♪

224
00:07:53,210 --> 00:07:57,330
♪Truth concealed, the night
stands still, and nothing leaves a mark♪

225
00:07:57,490 --> 00:08:01,610
♪An unsigned letter, coded words,
the solvers gather one by one♪

226
00:08:01,610 --> 00:08:05,730
♪A broken game, illusion reigns,
who's hiding what they've done?♪

227
00:08:05,730 --> 00:08:09,370
♪Hushed voices, nerves on edge,
wrapped in smoke and mirrors still♪

228
00:08:09,370 --> 00:08:11,490
♪The next second, deeper riddles,
or the answer to the kill♪

229
00:08:11,490 --> 00:08:15,450
♪Every piece of truth
has finally come to light♪

230
00:08:15,690 --> 00:08:19,610
♪Unlock the mystery, turn the question,
let's begin tonight♪

231
00:08:19,810 --> 00:08:23,970
♪Side by side, no holding back,
follow every clue to find the truth♪

232
00:08:23,970 --> 00:08:27,530
♪The story blurs like flowers in fog,
let's begin tonight♪

233
00:08:27,810 --> 00:08:32,450
♪Search for the vanished cipher,
trace the proof, and face the sleuth♪
